{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SYWMrFwDvawAzTmZXKAgv4","type":"tool_result","content":"# tri-planner\n\nGenerates structured triathlon workouts and pushes them to Intervals.icu, which\nexports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n\n- `gen.py` turns a plan (`plans/*.json`) into the body for\n  `POST /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events` (an event with `workout_doc`).\n- `push.sh` posts it (needs `INTERVALS_API_KEY` and `ATHLETE_ID`).\n- `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n  notes on what the watch displayed.\n\nAthlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\nin plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n\n```\npython3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n./push.sh event.json\n```\n----\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Build an Intervals.icu event body (workout_doc) from a plan file.\n\nUsage: python3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport sys\n\n\ndef hr_target(step):\n    \"\"\"HR corridor for a step, as a percentage of the athlete's LTHR.\"\"\"\n    lo, hi = step[\"hr_pct\"]\n    return {\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"value\": lo, \"end\": hi}\n\n\ndef build_step(step):\n    out = {\"duration\": step[\"minutes\"] * 60}\n    if \"hr_pct\" in step:\n        out[\"hr\"] = hr_target(step)\n    if \"label\" in step:\n        out[\"text\"] = step[\"label\"]\n    return out\n\n\ndef build_doc(plan):\n    steps = []\n    for block in plan[\"steps\"]:\n        if \"repeat\" in block:\n            steps.append({\n                \"reps\": block[\"repeat\"],\n                \"steps\": [build_step(s) for s in block[\"steps\"]],\n            })\n        else:\n            steps.append(build_step(block))\n    return {\"steps\": steps}\n\n\ndef build_event(plan):\n    return {\n        \"category\": \"WORKOUT\",\n        \"type\": plan[\"sport\"],\n        \"name\": plan[\"name\"],\n        \"start_date_local\": plan[\"date\"] + \"T00:00:00\",\n        \"workout_doc\": build_doc(plan),\n    }\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    with open(sys.argv[1]) as f:\n        plan = json.load(f)\n    json.dump(build_event(plan), sys.stdout, indent=2)\n    print()\n----\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# usage: ./push.sh event.json   (needs INTERVALS_API_KEY and ATHLETE_ID)\nset -eu\ncurl -sS -u \"API_KEY:${INTERVALS_API_KEY}\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -X POST \"https://intervals.icu/api/v1/athlete/${ATHLETE_ID}/events\" \\\n  --data-binary @\"$1\"\n----\n{\n  \"name\": \"Tempo run 45\",\n  \"sport\": \"Run\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-20\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"label\": \"Warm-up easy\", \"minutes\": 10, \"hr_pct\": [68, 75]},\n    {\"repeat\": 3, \"steps\": [\n      {\"label\": \"Tempo\", \"minutes\": 8, \"hr_pct\": [88, 93]},\n      {\"label\": \"Float\", \"minutes\": 2, \"hr_pct\": [75, 82]}\n    ]},\n    {\"label\": \"Cool-down\", \"minutes\": 5, \"hr_pct\": [65, 72]}\n  ]\n}\n----\n{\n  \"category\": \"WORKOUT\",\n  \"type\": \"Run\",\n  \"name\": \"Tempo run 45\",\n  \"start_date_local\": \"2026-10-20T00:00:00\",\n  \"workout_doc\": {\n    \"steps\": [\n      {\n        \"duration\": 600,\n        \"hr\": {\n          \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n          \"value\": 68,\n          \"end\": 75\n        },\n        \"text\": \"Warm-up easy\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"reps\": 3,\n        \"steps\": [\n          {\n            \"duration\": 480,\n            \"hr\": {\n              \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n              \"value\": 88,\n              \"end\": 93\n            },\n            \"text\": \"Tempo\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"duration\": 120,\n            \"hr\": {\n              \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n              \"value\": 75,\n              \"end\": 82\n            },\n            \"text\": \"Float\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"duration\": 300,\n        \"hr\": {\n          \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n          \"value\": 65,\n          \"end\": 72\n        },\n        \"text\": \"Cool-down\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n----\ntotal 12\ndrwx------   8 valentinakoniukhova wheel   256 Oct 26 23:47 .\ndrwxrwxrwt 356 root                wheel 11392 Oct 26 23:47 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 valentinakoniukhova wheel   384 Oct 26 23:47 .git\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel   699 Oct 26 23:47 README.md\n-rwxr-xr-x   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel  1283 Oct 26 23:47 gen.py\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 valentinakoniukhova wheel    96 Oct 26 23:47 plans\n-rwxr-xr-x   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel   276 Oct 26 23:47 push.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 valentinakoniukhova wheel   128 Oct 26 23:47 readback\nOn branch main\nnothing to commit, working tree clean","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"deb2f0dd-261f-4182-9b9c-6e597d2f4d90","uuid":"554ea13f-f3b1-400e-8e69-56b76ce3744e","timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:47:33.526Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# tri-planner\n\nGenerates structured triathlon workouts and pushes them to Intervals.icu, which\nexports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n\n- `gen.py` turns a plan (`plans/*.json`) into the body for\n  `POST /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events` (an event with `workout_doc`).\n- `push.sh` posts it (needs `INTERVALS_API_KEY` and `ATHLETE_ID`).\n- `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n  notes on what the watch displayed.\n\nAthlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\nin plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n\n```\npython3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n./push.sh event.json\n```\n----\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Build an Intervals.icu event body (workout_doc) from a plan file.\n\nUsage: python3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport sys\n\n\ndef hr_target(step):\n    \"\"\"HR corridor for a step, as a percentage of the athlete's LTHR.\"\"\"\n    lo, hi = step[\"hr_pct\"]\n    return {\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"value\": lo, \"end\": hi}\n\n\ndef build_step(step):\n    out = {\"duration\": step[\"minutes\"] * 60}\n    if \"hr_pct\" in step:\n        out[\"hr\"] = hr_target(step)\n    if \"label\" in step:\n        out[\"text\"] = step[\"label\"]\n    return out\n\n\ndef build_doc(plan):\n    steps = []\n    for block in plan[\"steps\"]:\n        if \"repeat\" in block:\n            steps.append({\n                \"reps\": block[\"repeat\"],\n                \"steps\": [build_step(s) for s in block[\"steps\"]],\n            })\n        else:\n            steps.append(build_step(block))\n    return {\"steps\": steps}\n\n\ndef build_event(plan):\n    return {\n        \"category\": \"WORKOUT\",\n        \"type\": plan[\"sport\"],\n        \"name\": plan[\"name\"],\n        \"start_date_local\": plan[\"date\"] + \"T00:00:00\",\n        \"workout_doc\": build_doc(plan),\n    }\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    with open(sys.argv[1]) as f:\n        plan = json.load(f)\n    json.dump(build_event(plan), sys.stdout, indent=2)\n    print()\n----\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# usage: ./push.sh event.json   (needs INTERVALS_API_KEY and ATHLETE_ID)\nset -eu\ncurl -sS -u \"API_KEY:${INTERVALS_API_KEY}\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -X POST \"https://intervals.icu/api/v1/athlete/${ATHLETE_ID}/events\" \\\n  --data-binary @\"$1\"\n----\n{\n  \"name\": \"Tempo run 45\",\n  \"sport\": \"Run\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-10-20\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\"label\": \"Warm-up easy\", \"minutes\": 10, \"hr_pct\": [68, 75]},\n    {\"repeat\": 3, \"steps\": [\n      {\"label\": \"Tempo\", \"minutes\": 8, \"hr_pct\": [88, 93]},\n      {\"label\": \"Float\", \"minutes\": 2, \"hr_pct\": [75, 82]}\n    ]},\n    {\"label\": \"Cool-down\", \"minutes\": 5, \"hr_pct\": [65, 72]}\n  ]\n}\n----\n{\n  \"category\": \"WORKOUT\",\n  \"type\": \"Run\",\n  \"name\": \"Tempo run 45\",\n  \"start_date_local\": \"2026-10-20T00:00:00\",\n  \"workout_doc\": {\n    \"steps\": [\n      {\n        \"duration\": 600,\n        \"hr\": {\n          \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n          \"value\": 68,\n          \"end\": 75\n        },\n        \"text\": \"Warm-up easy\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"reps\": 3,\n        \"steps\": [\n          {\n            \"duration\": 480,\n            \"hr\": {\n              \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n              \"value\": 88,\n              \"end\": 93\n            },\n            \"text\": \"Tempo\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"duration\": 120,\n            \"hr\": {\n              \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n              \"value\": 75,\n              \"end\": 82\n            },\n            \"text\": \"Float\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"duration\": 300,\n        \"hr\": {\n          \"units\": \"%lthr\",\n          \"value\": 65,\n          \"end\": 72\n        },\n        \"text\": \"Cool-down\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n----\ntotal 12\ndrwx------   8 valentinakoniukhova wheel   256 Oct 26 23:47 .\ndrwxrwxrwt 356 root                wheel 11392 Oct 26 23:47 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 valentinakoniukhova wheel   384 Oct 26 23:47 .git\n-rw-r--r--   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel   699 Oct 26 23:47 README.md\n-rwxr-xr-x   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel  1283 Oct 26 23:47 gen.py\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 valentinakoniukhova wheel    96 Oct 26 23:47 plans\n-rwxr-xr-x   1 valentinakoniukhova wheel   276 Oct 26 23:47 push.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 valentinakoniukhova wheel   128 Oct 26 23:47 readback\nOn branch main\nnothing to commit, working tree clean","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SYWMrFwDvawAzTmZXKAgv4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
